		{
			dependencies: ["7843988CB0F906B3"]
			description: [
				"Used to build a &dstorage network&r, it can be crafted into &6Framed Inventory Cable&r."
				""
				"When connecting a &6Storage Terminal&r, &6Crafting Terminal&r, or other containers, it must be used together with a &6Inventory Cable&r connector."
			]
			id: "17D8CDADACFB7134"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				icon: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
				id: "5A2C147659F191D6"
				item: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Connects inventories across long distance"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7DBD3D95D6FE5315"
				item: "toms_storage:ts.inventory_cable"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 3.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["06CFAD62C6DC65CA"]
			description: [
				"The &6Inventory Proxy&r is conceptually equivalent to extending one face of a container. In practice, it can be viewed as an &2input channel directed toward a specific side of a container&r."
				""
				"{image:kubejs:textures/task/tom_1.png width:160 height:90 align:1}"
				"The image illustrates a common setup: at the center is a &6Inventory Proxy&r, which &2points to the chest on the right highlighted in red&r. Meanwhile, by right-clicking the left side of the proxy with a diamond, the chest highlighted in blue on the left is registered as a &6template container&r within the system."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"{image:kubejs:textures/task/tom_2.png width:160 height:75 align:1}"
				""
				"The image shows the contents of the blue-framed chest. By configuring the item layout inside it, the &2Storage Proxy can control the container on the right&r, limiting it to match the template chest settings."
				""
				"In other words, &2each slot can only accept the corresponding item type&r, and item counts will not exceed the configured amount. If a slot in the template chest is left empty, it means any item is allowed to be inserted there."
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"After completing the template chest setup, inserting items into a hopper will cause them to be filled according to the configured limits. The &2order and method of insertion depend on the input direction&r."
				""
				"Since the proxy can be regarded as a &6input pipeline&r, the available input slots are restricted by the face where the container and proxy are connected."
				""
				"For example, if furnaces are placed on both the left and right sides, even if items are configured in the input slots, they can only flow into the fuel slot—because &2furnaces only accept inputs from the top&r."
				""
				""
				"{image:kubejs:textures/task/tom_3.png width:160 height:75 align:1}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"In addition, by renaming containers (such as chests) in an anvil using a key-value format, you can define certain container properties."
				""
				"Currently supported tags include:"
				""
				"- &6ignoreSize&r : ignores filter stack size limits"
				"- &6maxCount=<max value>&r : sets max stack count for empty slots"
				""
				""
				"For example, you can set &2ignoreSize=true&r to make the container ignore filter stack size limits."
			]
			id: "3A4DBF039CE9A9E9"
			rewards: [{
				count: 3
				id: "6FC6A6867709F689"
				item: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Flexible storage… but with limited use."
			tasks: [{
				id: "746A3841940970D5"
				item: "toms_storage:ts.inventory_proxy"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 7.25d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["06CFAD62C6DC65CA"]
			description: ["When held, it allows you to right-click and open the terminal interface from a greater distance (up to &516 blocks&r). The wireless terminal must be linked to the corresponding terminal before it can be used."]
			id: "0E870625DCF57C7A"
