		{
			dependencies: ["0E870625DCF57C7A"]
			description: [
				"Placing a single-layer Beacon next to a &6Inventory Connector&r allows the &6Advanced Wireless Terminal&r to open the storage interface from anywhere within the same world."
				""
				"If a max-level Beacon is placed, and the chunk is set to force-load using the FTB Map, the Advanced Wireless Terminal can even access the terminal across dimensions."
				""
				"In addition, one Beacon can support multiple &6Inventory Connector&r at the same time."
				""
				"&7To do this in FTB Map, open the map and go to the claimed chunks section in the top-left corner. Left-click to claim a chunk, then Shift + Left-click to force-load it. A striped pattern on the chunk indicates the operation was successful.&r"
			]
			icon: "toms_storage:ts.adv_wireless_terminal"
			id: "0004C045EF8274F8"
