		{
			dependencies: ["17D8CDADACFB7134"]
			description: [
				"Exposed cables look clumsy and unsightly, but not everyone has double-layer walls to hide their wiring."
				""
				"Therefore, craft some &6Framed Inventory Cables&r and use a &6Paint Kit&r to color and camouflage them. The cables will then blend seamlessly into their surroundings."
