		{
			dependencies: ["17D8CDADACFB7134"]
			description: [
				"Other than just directly connecting adjacent containers, you can also link containers (such as drawers) using a &2Inventory Cable Connector&r."
				""
				"Furthermore, placing the connector above a Beacon allows the item network to connect to the current dimension, as long as the beacon beam is not obstructed. By setting up another beacon elsewhere and configuring the connector’s top-right input/output settings, you can &2share contents between multiple networks regardless of distance&r."
				""
				"If a two-layer beacon setup is constructed, the network can even be shared across dimensions."
				""
				"Perhaps you could try building your own private network within a personal dimension."
			]
