		{
			dependencies: ["7EA63EFEECF4628D"]
			description: [
				"An &2Open Crate&r treats all items in the air block directly in front of it as if they were inside a container. Likewise, if the network inserts items into the Open Crate, they will be dropped into the space one block ahead."
				""
				"This is often used for item disposal or temporary buffering. It can also be useful in scenarios involving water-stream transportation or other world-based crafting systems."
			]
